<title>POLAND: Warta sees 1997 net up to PLN 26 mln.</title>
<headline>Warta sees 1997 net up to PLN 26 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish insurance firm TUiR Warta SA expects to lift net profit to 26 million zlotys in 1997 from 18.1 million in 1996, the company's president said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect that 1997 net profit will amount to about 26 million zlotys,&quot; Andrzej Witkowski told a news conference.</p>
<p>In January Warta said it was likely to show a net profit of between 20 million and 25 million zlotys in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
